# Build context for Dockerfile.app (the cloud-edition client stack). Keep it lean:
# node_modules and build artifacts are recreated in the image. Neither cloud/
# submodule is needed - the SDK runner reaches the AI Gateway directly, no
# private adapter or runner service to bundle.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/.svelte-kit
web/build
**/dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
docs/.vitepress/cache
docs/.vitepress/dist
extension/dist
cloud
private
.claude
.DS_Store
